  discover -> supported [the adapter enumerates the mobile Flow cases of the project through the ATS-602 catalogue; the project holds 1 mobile case(s); the device emulator-5554 is attached and answered adb]
  start -> supported [the adapter drives the device through the Android driver (launchApp / tapOn / assertVisible / takeScreenshot); the project holds 1 mobile case(s); the device emulator-5554 is attached and answered adb]
  stop -> supported [the adapter aborts the in-flight run and releases the device session; the project holds 1 mobile case(s); the device emulator-5554 is attached and answered adb]
  collect -> supported [the adapter maps the step results onto the common result model (passed/failed/skipped); the project holds 1 mobile case(s); the device emulator-5554 is attached and answered adb]
  filterByFile -> supported [the adapter selects the mobile cases of one Flow file; the project holds 1 mobile case(s); the device emulator-5554 is attached and answered adb]
  filterByTestUid -> supported [the adapter selects one mobile case by its ATS-201/ATS-602 UID; the project holds 1 mobile case(s); the device emulator-5554 is attached and answered adb]
  structuredReport -> supported [the adapter writes a JSON result file with the step results; the project holds 1 mobile case(s); the device emulator-5554 is attached and answered adb]
  htmlReport -> unsupported [the Android runner produces no HTML report; the result model and the evidence are the deliverable]
